  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **The Grey King And The Silver Flame Attunement** (1 other source): The list gives the opener as a song from the album Goths [1]\n- **Poltergeist** (1 other source): The uploader's list marks Poltergeist as a song with no album release [1]\n- **Puffin'** (1 other source): The list credits Puffin' to Lou Barlow and marks it as having no album release [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Alpha in Tauris**: rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n- **Poltergeist**: back after 196 archived shows (5269 days); rare: 10 archived performances [2]\n- **There Will Be No Divorce**: back after 28 archived shows (788 days) [2]\n- **Puffin'**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **New Chevrolet in Flames**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Paid in Cocaine**: rare: 10 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tMG2017-11-08** (recommended): source not stated; 21 songs; 96 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tMG2017-11-08**: taped by Bryce Carr; transferred by notasfarwest; source: WAV > Audacity > MP3 [1]",
